    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d353">

                <pb facs="0509" n="421" sameAs="frus:frus1892/pg421"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Rives to Mr.
                            Strobel.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-10-10"><hi rendition="#italic">October 10,
                        1888</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 326.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose a copy of a portion of a letter
                    recently received from the Rev. Judson Smith relative to the amount of indemnity
                    due the Rev. Mr. Doane for injuries inflicted on him by the Spanish authorities
                    at Ponape.</p>
                <p>You are instructed to press for compensation for proven losses and expenses and
                    to suggest the pleasure with which this Government would view the tender to Mr.
                    Doane of reparation proportionate to the personal grievances to which he has
                    been subjected.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">G. L. Rives</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d353-a1.xml" xpointer="d353-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
